<title>UK: Anlaysts' consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>Anlaysts' consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending July 19 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, July 16</p>
<p>Smith (David S) Plc    F   PFT	 92.2	 90.0-96.0</p>
<p>124.6</p>
<p>			 DIV	  8.0	  7.6-8.0</p>
<p>7.5</p>
<p>				   EPS	 21.9	 20.3-23.1</p>
<p>30.3</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of</p>
<p>PFT 90.0 DIV 8.0 EPS 21.6)</p>
<p>Somerfield Plc	   F   PFT	103.2	101.9-105.0</p>
<p>91.8</p>
<p>			  DIV	 10.2	 10.0-10.3</p>
<p>N/A</p>
<p>				   EPS	 26.9	 25.2-28.5</p>
<p>23.4</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of</p>
<p>PFT 103.0 DIV 10.2 EPS 27.6)</p>
<p>THURSDAY, July 17</p>
<p>Medeva Plc		 H   PFT	 48.1	44.5-52.0</p>
<p>33.9</p>
<p>Stanley Leisure	  F   PFT	 19.2	18.0-20.0</p>
<p>14.8</p>
<p>			  DIV	  3.6	 3.5-4.0</p>
<p>3.3</p>
<p>				   EPS	 11.8	11.2-12.2</p>
<p>11.8 (Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 19.1 DIV 3.8 EPS 11.9)</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
